<!-- Languages offered in Android 13+ Settings > Apps > (app) > Language. To add one: add res/values-<lang>/strings.xml,
     a <locale> line here, <lang> in androidResources.localeFilters (build.gradle.kts) and in Langs.ALL (Langs.kt). -->
